1
00:00:45,718 --> 00:00:51,423
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The first thing you need
to know about Rose is, uh...</font>

2
00:00:52,858 --> 00:00:54,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS">she ain't exactly human.</font>

3
00:00:59,999 --> 00:01:05,638
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Her parents were,
at least until the lights fell.</font>

4
00:01:11,677 --> 00:01:15,413
<font face="Comic Sans MS">From there,
it gets complicated.</font>

5
00:01:15,447 --> 00:01:16,614
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Jarrod?</i></font>

6
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:20,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They harvested
her father's mind.</font>

7
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:24,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They couldn't erase his will.</font>

8
00:01:26,926 --> 00:01:30,663
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He sacrificed his life
to save Rose.</font>

9
00:01:30,696 --> 00:01:32,497
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But there was another.</font>

10
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:34,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A father
in search of his son...</font>

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS">...took her in as his own.</font>

12
00:01:38,570 --> 00:01:43,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Something in that blue light
made little Rose grow fast.</font>

13
00:01:44,609 --> 00:01:45,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Too fast.</font>

14
00:01:45,845 --> 00:01:50,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Blood transfusions
helped slow it down.</font>

15
00:01:50,315 --> 00:01:52,617
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But that's not all
she inherited.</font>

16
00:01:56,689 --> 00:02:01,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Her powers freed every pilot
on Earth,</font>

17
00:02:01,526 --> 00:02:03,996
<font face="Comic Sans MS">reuniting families...</font>

18
00:02:04,830 --> 00:02:07,833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and creating new ones.</font>

19
00:02:07,867 --> 00:02:13,038
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Over the next 10 years,
Rose and her brother turned the tide...</font>

20
00:02:13,072 --> 00:02:15,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ready?</i></font>

21
00:02:15,473 --> 00:02:21,781
<font face="Comic Sans MS">...until the Harvesters unveiled
their ultimate weapon, the Armada Vessel.</font>

22
00:02:21,814 --> 00:02:28,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Said to harvest all life on
our planet with a single blast.</font>

23
00:02:35,027 --> 00:02:38,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We had one chance
left to stop it.</font>

24
00:02:38,764 --> 00:02:43,769
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The Red Fleet cleared a path
and Rose had her shot.</font>

25
00:02:47,006 --> 00:02:48,573
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But she froze.</font>

26
00:02:50,810 --> 00:02:52,343
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No one knows why.</font>

27
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:59,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But it was just long enough
for everything to fall apart.</font>

28
00:03:01,754 --> 00:03:05,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS">One of our ships got caught
in the crossfire.</font>

29
00:03:07,993 --> 00:03:10,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To save all mankind,</font>

30
00:03:10,863 --> 00:03:16,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS">she had to kill
thousands of her own men.</font>

31
00:03:27,847 --> 00:03:32,117
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The price of victory
was too much for her to bear.</i></font>

32
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:36,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose turned her back
on it all.</i></font>

33
00:03:38,023 --> 00:03:40,025
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's been 5 years.</i></font>

34
00:03:41,694 --> 00:03:44,063
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We haven't seen
the Harvesters since.</i></font>

35
00:03:45,197 --> 00:03:48,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about Rose?
Where is she?</i></font>

36
00:03:48,533 --> 00:03:50,703
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Excuse me, love.</i></font>

37
00:03:50,736 --> 00:03:52,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm looking for Rose Corley.
Have you seen her?</i></font>

38
00:03:53,706 --> 00:03:56,075
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Popular question these days.</i></font>

39
00:03:56,108 --> 00:04:00,578
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Evening, ladies and gentlemen.
Sorry to break up story time.</i></font>

40
00:04:00,612 --> 00:04:02,748
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm looking for this lady,
Rose Corley.</i></font>

41
00:04:04,950 --> 00:04:06,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Have you seen her?</i></font>

42
00:04:09,688 --> 00:04:11,991
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hiya, what's your name?</i></font>

43
00:04:12,024 --> 00:04:13,591
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Kate.
- Hi, Kate.</i></font>

44
00:04:14,693 --> 00:04:16,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You haven't seen her around,
have you?</i></font>

45
00:04:16,629 --> 00:04:19,430
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She might look a little bit older.
Maybe a lot.</i></font>

46
00:04:20,933 --> 00:04:23,702
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- No, not lately...
- Not ever.</i></font>

47
00:04:25,603 --> 00:04:27,505
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I wasn't
talking to you, Popeye.</i></font>

48
00:04:29,775 --> 00:04:31,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So which is it,
not lately or not ever?</i></font>

49
00:04:38,616 --> 00:04:40,719
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You know, reward's up
to a million.</i></font>

50
00:04:43,554 --> 00:04:45,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>More than enough to
get out of this shithole.</i></font>

51
00:04:45,758 --> 00:04:48,027
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Find yourself
a nice little gated complex.</i></font>

52
00:04:50,829 --> 00:04:53,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just keep your eye open,
eh, old man?</i></font>

53
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,775
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Asshole.</i></font>

54
00:05:02,808 --> 00:05:05,978
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Anyone seen Rose Corley,
this girl here?</i></font>

55
00:05:07,846 --> 00:05:10,149
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Kev, have you checked these guys?
- On it.</i></font>

56
00:05:14,219 --> 00:05:16,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right, mate.
I'm looking for this girl.</i></font>

57
00:05:16,689 --> 00:05:17,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No?</i></font>

58
00:05:18,724 --> 00:05:19,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose Corley?</i></font>

59
00:05:20,993 --> 00:05:23,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Caught anything?
- No, nothing.</i></font>

60
00:06:11,176 --> 00:06:13,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I just need a refill, Doc.
Then I'm gone.</i></font>

61
00:06:13,846 --> 00:06:17,582
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Jesus, what the hell.
You couldn't have chosen a worse time.</i></font>

62
00:06:20,085 --> 00:06:21,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You owe me one.</i></font>

63
00:06:23,989 --> 00:06:25,190
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get in here.</i></font>

64
00:06:31,764 --> 00:06:34,033
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You weren't kidding.</i></font>

65
00:06:34,066 --> 00:06:35,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Nasty bug
going around.</i></font>

66
00:06:35,634 --> 00:06:37,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Dublin's already
been quarantined.</i></font>

67
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:45,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know it's only a band-aid,
but the hyper-oxygenated blood seems</i></font>

68
00:06:45,077 --> 00:06:47,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>to have slowed down
your cell replication.</i></font>

69
00:06:47,913 --> 00:06:50,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Except, this shit
keeps getting worse.</i></font>

70
00:06:50,482 --> 00:06:53,752
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Your firing hand.</i></font>

71
00:06:53,786 --> 00:06:57,990
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Concentrated exposure increases
the effects of ageing, I'm afraid.</i></font>

72
00:06:58,023 --> 00:07:00,125
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can always replace it,
like Huana's.</i></font>

73
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:04,196
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How is the old Chief
holding up?</i></font>

74
00:07:04,229 --> 00:07:06,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He's not doing
too well, either.</i></font>

75
00:07:06,165 --> 00:07:08,867
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>His transplants got
infected by this new virus.</i></font>

76
00:07:08,901 --> 00:07:12,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Had to replace his leg again,
poor old bugger.</i></font>

77
00:07:12,704 --> 00:07:14,973
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, I'd like to keep
my cuticles if I can.</i></font>

78
00:07:15,007 --> 00:07:17,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't knock it till you try it,
young lady.</i></font>

79
00:07:18,077 --> 00:07:19,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Sure, Doc.</i></font>

80
00:07:22,414 --> 00:07:23,916
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let me show you something.</i></font>

81
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ray, here,
was our first case.</i></font>

82
00:07:28,253 --> 00:07:29,888
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What are the symptoms?</i></font>

83
00:07:29,922 --> 00:07:34,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Thyroxine levels are way up. And the bodies
are eating themselves from the inside.</i></font>

84
00:07:34,726 --> 00:07:38,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm working on an anti-viral,
but it's unlike anything I've seen before.</i></font>

85
00:07:41,333 --> 00:07:43,735
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What you doing that for?
Where's the girl? Where is she?</i></font>

86
00:07:43,769 --> 00:07:44,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Backdoor.</i></font>

87
00:07:46,939 --> 00:07:48,140
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Relax!</i></font>

88
00:07:53,278 --> 00:07:55,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come for your monthly
check-up?</i></font>

89
00:07:57,916 --> 00:07:58,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stand down.</i></font>

90
00:08:09,795 --> 00:08:10,796
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Freeze!</i></font>

91
00:08:21,039 --> 00:08:22,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We gotta stop meeting
like this.</i></font>

92
00:08:27,146 --> 00:08:28,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose Corley...</i></font>

93
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ray, stop!</i></font>

94
00:08:37,289 --> 00:08:38,357
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't shoot!</i></font>

95
00:08:42,127 --> 00:08:43,729
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose Corley...</i></font>

96
00:08:45,063 --> 00:08:47,399
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>you're under arrest.</i></font>

97
00:08:47,432 --> 00:08:49,835
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Rose?
- Out the way, or I'll arrest you too.</i></font>

98
00:08:49,868 --> 00:08:52,738
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What charges? What the hell
is going on here?</i></font>

99
00:08:52,771 --> 00:08:54,673
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whole city's under quarantine.</i></font>

100
00:08:59,311 --> 00:09:02,347
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We have another
blue shell contained in the infirmary.</font>

101
00:09:02,381 --> 00:09:04,149
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We've locked down
the whole sector.</font>

102
00:09:20,766 --> 00:09:21,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Did he find you?</i></font>

103
00:09:23,101 --> 00:09:25,137
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Your dad.</i></font>

104
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:28,373
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- You don't think I know who Mark Corley is?
- You don't.</i></font>

105
00:09:28,407 --> 00:09:32,077
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, I know he's the famous
founder of the Resistance.</i></font>

106
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:37,115
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And I know he'd probably still be
alive today... if you hadn't run away.</i></font>

107
00:10:02,274 --> 00:10:03,275
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go.</i></font>

108
00:10:13,051 --> 00:10:14,186
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Welcome back.</i></font>

109
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Home sweet home.</i></font>

110
00:10:30,502 --> 00:10:33,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Right here.</i></font>

111
00:10:33,272 --> 00:10:37,943
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Gotta hand it to you, Corporal.
Job well done. Drinks are on me.</i></font>

112
00:10:37,976 --> 00:10:39,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't forget your wallet
this time, huh?</i></font>

113
00:10:39,244 --> 00:10:40,412
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I never
forget anything.</i></font>

114
00:10:40,445 --> 00:10:42,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Except when
it's your turn to pay.</i></font>

115
00:10:44,483 --> 00:10:46,852
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Careful.
- I don't take orders from you.</i></font>

116
00:10:47,352 --> 00:10:48,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And you are?</i></font>

117
00:10:50,055 --> 00:10:52,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Colonel Owens.</i></font>

118
00:10:52,324 --> 00:10:55,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But save your salute.
You don't have any rank here anymore.</i></font>

119
00:10:59,398 --> 00:11:01,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're our best
weapon, Rose.</font>

120
00:11:01,233 --> 00:11:05,937
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Do you really think I would
let you just walk away?</i></font>

121
00:11:06,605 --> 00:11:08,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I thought the war was over.</i></font>

122
00:11:08,641 --> 00:11:11,276
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I won it for you at too high
of a price.</i></font>

123
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:15,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There is only one thing
harder than winning a war.</i></font>

124
00:11:23,588 --> 00:11:26,358
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Keeping the peace.</i></font>

125
00:11:26,391 --> 00:11:28,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wise beyond your years.</i></font>

126
00:11:32,597 --> 00:11:34,066
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You remember Violet.</i></font>

127
00:11:35,167 --> 00:11:37,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah. 'Sup, Vi?</i></font>

128
00:11:38,136 --> 00:11:39,304
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Nice ink.</i></font>

129
00:11:43,241 --> 00:11:48,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This is approximately every
human being alive on Earth.</i></font>

130
00:11:49,614 --> 00:11:52,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And this is every freed Pilot.</i></font>

131
00:11:52,184 --> 00:11:55,220
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>For the past 5 years we've
co-existed, more or less, peacefully.</i></font>

132
00:11:55,987 --> 00:11:57,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Until now.</i></font>

133
00:11:58,090 --> 00:12:00,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The Pilots are dying, Rose.</i></font>

134
00:12:00,559 --> 00:12:04,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What you saw today
is only the beginning.</i></font>

135
00:12:04,363 --> 00:12:06,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Soon they'll all revert
to their base biology,</i></font>

136
00:12:06,699 --> 00:12:09,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>triggering a brutal hunt
for resources,</i></font>

137
00:12:09,635 --> 00:12:14,539
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>which means they'll go back to
ripping our bloody brains out.</i></font>

138
00:12:14,573 --> 00:12:16,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How do you know that for sure?</i></font>

139
00:12:16,408 --> 00:12:19,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A few isolated cases
doesn't make a pandemic.</i></font>

140
00:12:19,244 --> 00:12:22,547
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We've already lost thousands
in Dublin.</i></font>

141
00:12:22,581 --> 00:12:26,151
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If we don't find a solution in the
next 72 hours, London will be next.</i></font>

142
00:12:27,586 --> 00:12:31,156
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>However, we may have one.</i></font>

143
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The Armada?</i></font>

144
00:12:37,596 --> 00:12:41,466
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Harvester ships have resilient core
drives which repair their tech.</i></font>

145
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:44,670
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But every one of them we've converted
put together won't be able to stem</i></font>

146
00:12:44,704 --> 00:12:48,507
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>the tide of 3 billion
Pilots. The Armadas can.</i></font>

147
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:54,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's core drive is powerful enough to
restore every Pilot on Earth for 100 years.</i></font>

148
00:12:55,681 --> 00:12:58,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But I destroyed it
5 years ago.</i></font>

149
00:12:59,251 --> 00:13:00,585
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Take a closer look.</i></font>

150
00:13:05,357 --> 00:13:10,996
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's core warped out.
Right before impact.</i></font>

151
00:13:13,131 --> 00:13:15,000
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And you know where it went?</i></font>

152
00:13:15,033 --> 00:13:18,136
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We cracked their entire
navigational database.</i></font>

153
00:13:18,170 --> 00:13:20,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All the way back to this world.</i></font>

154
00:13:21,273 --> 00:13:24,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're calling it Cobalt One.</i></font>

155
00:13:24,276 --> 00:13:27,612
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Every question we've ever
asked... Where are they from?</i></font>

156
00:13:27,647 --> 00:13:31,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Who are they? What do
they really want?</i></font>

157
00:13:31,082 --> 00:13:35,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All the answers lie on
that shiny, blue rock.</i></font>

158
00:13:36,188 --> 00:13:41,293
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The only way that we can
defend our hard-fought peace,</i></font>

159
00:13:41,326 --> 00:13:44,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>ensure a secure future
for all humanity,</i></font>

160
00:13:44,062 --> 00:13:48,033
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>hybrid or otherwise,
is to get there.</i></font>

161
00:13:49,669 --> 00:13:53,538
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're embarking on the first
manned mission to Cobalt One,</i></font>

162
00:13:53,572 --> 00:13:57,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>and I want you to join us.</i></font>

163
00:13:57,643 --> 00:14:00,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've assembled a team.
The very best our planet has to offer.</i></font>

164
00:14:00,813 --> 00:14:03,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You already know Leon.
Our hunter.</i></font>

165
00:14:03,716 --> 00:14:06,786
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>As of now, he is your personal escort.</i></font>

166
00:14:06,819 --> 00:14:09,187
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi, here, cracked
their navigation network.</i></font>

167
00:14:09,221 --> 00:14:13,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thanks to him, we can travel
5 light years in a single day.</font>

168
00:14:13,726 --> 00:14:17,195
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Colonel Owens. Former Navy Seals.
Sniper by trade.</i></font>

169
00:14:17,229 --> 00:14:19,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He can be a bit of a prick sometimes.</i></font>

170
00:14:20,700 --> 00:14:23,335
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But there isn't anyone I'd
rather have covering my 6.</i></font>

171
00:14:23,368 --> 00:14:24,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Who's she?</i></font>

172
00:14:24,637 --> 00:14:26,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi ran a counterstrike
unit in Eastern Europe,</i></font>

173
00:14:26,839 --> 00:14:30,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>specializing in target tracking,
search and destroy.</i></font>

174
00:14:30,208 --> 00:14:33,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS">She could find a needle
in the proverbial haystack.</font>

175
00:14:35,213 --> 00:14:38,651
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And execute it with
extreme prejudice.</i></font>

176
00:14:45,223 --> 00:14:47,492
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So, what exactly
is my role in all this?</i></font>

177
00:14:47,526 --> 00:14:49,795
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We need your powers
to detach the core drive.</i></font>

178
00:14:49,829 --> 00:14:52,832
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Redford,
I've never done that before.</i></font>

179
00:14:52,865 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, it's the first manned
mission to an alien planet.</i></font>

180
00:14:55,233 --> 00:14:56,669
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There's a lot of new
for everybody.</i></font>

181
00:14:56,702 --> 00:14:58,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But you'll have all the blood
transfusions you need</i></font>

182
00:14:58,804 --> 00:15:00,673
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>to keep your powers
at full strength.</i></font>

183
00:15:03,241 --> 00:15:04,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What, are you keeping them
separate now?</i></font>

184
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:06,679
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They seem
to prefer it this way.</i></font>

185
00:15:08,213 --> 00:15:11,817
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But we have found you
a roommate.</i></font>

186
00:15:13,686 --> 00:15:14,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent?</i></font>

187
00:15:17,155 --> 00:15:18,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'll leave you to it.</i></font>

188
00:15:22,494 --> 00:15:25,096
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Nice to see you, too.</i></font>

189
00:15:27,265 --> 00:15:29,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Jesus. It smells like
a Pilot brothel in here.</i></font>

190
00:15:31,136 --> 00:15:33,104
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah? Well, I haven't showered
in, like, a year.</i></font>

191
00:15:33,138 --> 00:15:34,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What's your excuse?</i></font>

192
00:15:37,509 --> 00:15:38,510
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What are you working on?</i></font>

193
00:15:42,414 --> 00:15:43,415
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Need a hand?</i></font>

194
00:15:44,382 --> 00:15:45,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I brought thumbs.</i></font>

195
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You name it,
I've been there.</i></font>

196
00:15:51,691 --> 00:15:53,759
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, L.A. was all right,
I guess.</i></font>

197
00:15:56,161 --> 00:15:57,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, you could have come.</i></font>

198
00:15:58,129 --> 00:16:00,231
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't act like
you weren't invited.</i></font>

199
00:16:03,234 --> 00:16:04,837
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Reminded me of you and dad,
actually.</i></font>

200
00:16:09,507 --> 00:16:11,376
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent, I looked everywhere
for him, but I...</i></font>

201
00:16:19,618 --> 00:16:22,220
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't. It's my fault
he's missing.</i></font>

202
00:16:24,724 --> 00:16:25,791
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't just give up on him.</i></font>

203
00:16:27,827 --> 00:16:29,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You work for the people
who are hunting me.</i></font>

204
00:16:29,361 --> 00:16:31,864
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't just stop in
and say hi.</i></font>

205
00:16:35,433 --> 00:16:38,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit. I'm sorry.</i></font>

206
00:16:38,303 --> 00:16:40,372
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't even imagine
what this is all like for you.</i></font>

207
00:16:45,243 --> 00:16:47,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And you actually think Redford's
mission is going to work?</i></font>

208
00:16:56,956 --> 00:16:59,224
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's not that
I don't wanna help...</i></font>

209
00:17:03,561 --> 00:17:05,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I don't know if I can anymore.</i></font>

210
00:17:07,232 --> 00:17:10,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Every time I use this...
I pay the price.</i></font>

211
00:17:11,003 --> 00:17:13,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Or worse,
someone else does.</i></font>

212
00:17:14,539 --> 00:17:16,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Maybe you're just
better off without me.</i></font>

213
00:17:28,754 --> 00:17:30,488
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Why are they always wet?</i></font>

214
00:17:42,001 --> 00:17:46,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Rose, always knew.
It's Rose.</font>

215
00:17:46,438 --> 00:17:48,941
<font face="Comic Sans MS">'Cause I made a promise.
You know what that means?</font>

216
00:17:48,974 --> 00:17:54,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That means, that no matter what happens,
I'm not going to let anything hurt you.</i></font>

217
00:17:54,847 --> 00:17:56,214
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Promise?</i></font>

218
00:18:00,418 --> 00:18:03,421
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, kid. I promise.</i></font>

219
00:18:12,631 --> 00:18:14,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Morning, sleeping beauty.</i></font>

220
00:18:14,399 --> 00:18:17,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- General wants to see you.
- Why? Wh... Where's Trent?</i></font>

221
00:18:17,402 --> 00:18:18,938
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He's with the others.
Waiting for you.</i></font>

222
00:18:18,971 --> 00:18:20,773
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hmm.</i></font>

223
00:18:20,806 --> 00:18:23,008
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let them. I gotta shower.</i></font>

224
00:18:24,944 --> 00:18:27,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Leave.
- I'll be outside, then.</i></font>

225
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:28,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Okay.</i></font>

226
00:18:43,729 --> 00:18:46,598
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So are you supposed
to just follow me around?</i></font>

227
00:18:46,632 --> 00:18:48,934
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's what I volunteered for.</i></font>

228
00:18:48,968 --> 00:18:51,469
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wow. Mom and dad
must be proud.</i></font>

229
00:18:51,503 --> 00:18:53,538
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ah, can't all be as special
as you, can we?</i></font>

230
00:18:57,810 --> 00:18:59,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What happened
to all the Tankers?</i></font>

231
00:18:59,044 --> 00:19:00,478
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Need to conserve power.</i></font>

232
00:19:00,512 --> 00:19:02,114
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Can't afford to carry
all that extra weight.</i></font>

233
00:19:02,148 --> 00:19:05,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Still, you never know when a 40
foot tall bulldozer could come in handy.</i></font>

234
00:19:05,885 --> 00:19:07,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The General wants to
brief you on the bridge.</i></font>

235
00:19:07,887 --> 00:19:10,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just keeps getting
better and better.</i></font>

236
00:19:10,656 --> 00:19:14,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>For those of you haven't served with
her, or have been living under a rock,</i></font>

237
00:19:14,459 --> 00:19:18,596
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose, here, had been blessed with the
ability to interact with alien tech,</i></font>

238
00:19:18,631 --> 00:19:20,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>counteract their programming.</i></font>

239
00:19:20,699 --> 00:19:22,333
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And having faced
the Armada already,</i></font>

240
00:19:22,367 --> 00:19:24,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>she has an intimate
knowledge of our target.</i></font>

241
00:19:24,804 --> 00:19:28,540
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So, let's get her up to speed with the
mission as quickly as possible. Zhi?</i></font>

242
00:19:28,573 --> 00:19:32,678
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>First things first. How many times have
you actually travelled by wormhole?</i></font>

243
00:19:32,711 --> 00:19:35,714
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, we've travelled
to the Moon. Mars...</i></font>

244
00:19:35,748 --> 00:19:37,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's a walk in the park
compared to this.</i></font>

245
00:19:37,515 --> 00:19:38,717
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No one said
it would be easy, honey.</i></font>

246
00:19:38,751 --> 00:19:39,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, no one's talking
to you, honey.</i></font>

247
00:19:40,653 --> 00:19:41,619
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about probes?</i></font>

248
00:19:41,654 --> 00:19:43,255
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Any successful unmanned
missions to Cobalt?</i></font>

249
00:19:43,289 --> 00:19:46,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No. We've sent them, but it'll be
5 years before we receive a signal back...</i></font>

250
00:19:46,125 --> 00:19:48,627
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So, aside from our nav
holograms, we have no real intel</i></font>

251
00:19:48,661 --> 00:19:49,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>what this planet's
actually like?</i></font>

252
00:19:49,361 --> 00:19:53,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>As we exit the wormhole, we'll launch a
satellite probe and do a full planetary scan.</i></font>

253
00:19:53,699 --> 00:19:56,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Mmm. And what happens
when we run into Harvesters?</i></font>

254
00:19:56,101 --> 00:19:57,535
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We blend in.</i></font>

255
00:19:57,569 --> 00:20:01,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We change the ship back to its old
blue color. Along with our Pilots.</i></font>

256
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:04,944
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent and Violet will pose as
a derelict ship returning home.</i></font>

257
00:20:04,977 --> 00:20:08,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Okay, relax.</i></font>

258
00:20:08,413 --> 00:20:11,382
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Once we touch down, your team
will infiltrate the Armada Vessel,</i></font>

259
00:20:11,416 --> 00:20:15,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>under the radar, locate and
commandeer the core drive and then...</i></font>

260
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:17,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>get the hell out of dodge.</i></font>

261
00:20:22,628 --> 00:20:23,629
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's it?</i></font>

262
00:20:24,596 --> 00:20:25,597
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's all you got?</i></font>

263
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:29,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Oh, so you have half a plan.
- Yeah, at best.</i></font>

264
00:20:31,837 --> 00:20:35,074
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But it's a really
good half, though.</i></font>

265
00:20:35,107 --> 00:20:38,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We've simulated this mission,
roughly, 500 times with 90%...</i></font>

266
00:20:38,177 --> 00:20:40,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Simulations are nothing
compared to the real thing.</i></font>

267
00:20:40,079 --> 00:20:41,113
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's why we need you.</i></font>

268
00:20:41,146 --> 00:20:42,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't take on
an entire planet.</i></font>

269
00:20:43,015 --> 00:20:44,884
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This is no war.
This is a heist.</i></font>

270
00:20:44,917 --> 00:20:46,517
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're not going there
for any hero bullshit.</i></font>

271
00:20:46,551 --> 00:20:48,754
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let them harvest another
10 planets, for all we care.</i></font>

272
00:20:48,787 --> 00:20:51,190
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We go there for one thing
and one thing only.</i></font>

273
00:20:51,223 --> 00:20:53,826
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- That drive.
- You're the only one who has the power to retrieve it.</i></font>

274
00:20:53,859 --> 00:20:55,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Enough.</i></font>

275
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:56,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Colonel, give us the bridge.</i></font>

276
00:20:56,795 --> 00:20:58,496
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Sir. Let's go.</i></font>

277
00:21:00,633 --> 00:21:03,168
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There has to be
an easier way.</i></font>

278
00:21:04,870 --> 00:21:05,871
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose.</i></font>

279
00:21:07,505 --> 00:21:09,875
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You are the only way.</i></font>

280
00:21:09,909 --> 00:21:16,115
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know this is far from ideal,
but we face extermination.</i></font>

281
00:21:16,148 --> 00:21:18,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We all have to push
beyond our limits.</i></font>

282
00:21:22,021 --> 00:21:23,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And what if I can't?</i></font>

283
00:21:23,756 --> 00:21:27,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You saved us all before.
And when the time comes,</i></font>

284
00:21:27,558 --> 00:21:30,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know that you will
make us proud.</i></font>

285
00:21:38,003 --> 00:21:39,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>When do you embark?</i></font>

286
00:21:39,238 --> 00:21:41,073
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>As soon as you say yes.</i></font>

287
00:21:43,909 --> 00:21:46,078
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So what the hell
are we waiting for?</i></font>

288
00:22:10,601 --> 00:22:12,938
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wormhole travel
is extremely dangerous.</i></font>

289
00:22:12,972 --> 00:22:16,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>From the pressure, to the revolving
walls, its safest if you stay</i></font>

290
00:22:16,709 --> 00:22:18,543
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>in here at the center
of the ship.</i></font>

291
00:22:18,576 --> 00:22:19,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Or what?</i></font>

292
00:22:19,845 --> 00:22:23,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get too close to the outer
walls, you become part of them.</i></font>

293
00:22:23,882 --> 00:22:25,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Permanently.</i></font>

294
00:22:29,788 --> 00:22:34,860
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Doors open in 24 hours.
So, try to get some rest.</i></font>

295
00:22:34,893 --> 00:22:40,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And Rose, as long as we get the job
done, you and I will get along just fine.</i></font>

296
00:23:25,344 --> 00:23:26,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, hell, no.</i></font>

297
00:23:30,649 --> 00:23:31,184
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Owens!</i></font>

298
00:23:31,217 --> 00:23:34,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, we're on lockdown for 24 hours,
so I'm afraid you're stuck with me.</i></font>

299
00:23:34,086 --> 00:23:35,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This is a huge mistake.</i></font>

300
00:23:43,929 --> 00:23:47,066
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- You all right?
- Mmm, no. No, not really.</i></font>

301
00:23:47,099 --> 00:23:50,702
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, well, this ain't exactly
my idea of a good time either.</i></font>

302
00:23:50,736 --> 00:23:53,672
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait... Were you
watching me change?</i></font>

303
00:23:53,705 --> 00:23:56,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What? No, I was having a piss.</i></font>

304
00:23:57,409 --> 00:23:59,577
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah. Yep.</i></font>

305
00:24:06,085 --> 00:24:08,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Soldiers said to leave
before dark.</i></font>

306
00:24:09,421 --> 00:24:12,057
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, better get going.</i></font>

307
00:24:12,091 --> 00:24:13,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm not leaving without you.</i></font>

308
00:24:15,928 --> 00:24:20,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've spent 10 years hiding
underground, living in shit.</i></font>

309
00:24:20,699 --> 00:24:25,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'd just as soon see the end
up here, sun shining on my face.</i></font>

310
00:24:27,306 --> 00:24:29,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Thought I'd told you
to quit.</i></font>

311
00:24:31,143 --> 00:24:33,412
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, Doc. They kick you
out as well?</i></font>

312
00:24:33,445 --> 00:24:39,118
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Managed to sneak Huana,
here, in past quarantine. Just.</i></font>

313
00:24:39,151 --> 00:24:41,153
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Why? Is he sick or something?</i></font>

314
00:24:46,191 --> 00:24:47,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get him inside. Come on.</i></font>

315
00:24:52,865 --> 00:24:54,733
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So what's with
all the blood?</i></font>

316
00:24:54,766 --> 00:24:57,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Some kinda Dracula or...</i></font>

317
00:24:57,236 --> 00:24:59,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, no, wait.
Vampires don't age.</i></font>

318
00:24:59,705 --> 00:25:02,374
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whereas you're more of a...
Like a kid alien</i></font>

319
00:25:02,407 --> 00:25:05,911
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>in Tom Hanks' body,
kinda deal, right?</i></font>

320
00:25:05,944 --> 00:25:09,181
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What, you've never seen Big?
It's a classic.</i></font>

321
00:25:09,214 --> 00:25:12,718
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I have no idea what
you're talking about.</i></font>

322
00:25:12,751 --> 00:25:15,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You don't remember what
it was like before they came?</i></font>

323
00:25:15,320 --> 00:25:18,157
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I was born
on a spaceship, genius.</i></font>

324
00:25:18,190 --> 00:25:22,227
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, yeah. Right. Of course.</i></font>

325
00:25:29,101 --> 00:25:32,337
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How old were you
when they came?</i></font>

326
00:25:32,604 --> 00:25:34,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Um...</i></font>

327
00:25:34,239 --> 00:25:36,108
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I was in high school.</i></font>

328
00:25:37,409 --> 00:25:42,114
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The night before, my mum caught
me and my sister smoking a joint.</i></font>

329
00:25:42,147 --> 00:25:44,082
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grounded us for life.</i></font>

330
00:25:44,116 --> 00:25:47,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I don't know how you all survived
that many years as teenagers.</i></font>

331
00:25:47,352 --> 00:25:51,757
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That was the one time in my life I
was glad I grew up freakishly fast.</i></font>

332
00:25:56,828 --> 00:25:58,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'd give anything to go back.</i></font>

333
00:26:01,233 --> 00:26:03,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Never even saw my mum again.</i></font>

334
00:26:04,002 --> 00:26:08,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>My sister, Izzy, and me,
we ended up in a train station.</i></font>

335
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:10,876
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Worked our way to the
underground like most folks.</i></font>

336
00:26:11,810 --> 00:26:12,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not much food.</i></font>

337
00:26:12,978 --> 00:26:14,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Even less info.</i></font>

338
00:26:17,516 --> 00:26:19,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I just remember the fear.</i></font>

339
00:26:22,054 --> 00:26:23,388
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Being scared.</i></font>

340
00:26:25,791 --> 00:26:28,427
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Thinking they'd
find us any day.</i></font>

341
00:26:28,460 --> 00:26:31,897
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Until my sister told me
about this strange</i></font>

342
00:26:31,930 --> 00:26:33,899
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>little girl with
glowing red eyes.</i></font>

343
00:26:33,932 --> 00:26:35,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The one who could fight back.</i></font>

344
00:26:41,139 --> 00:26:44,343
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And your sister? Where's she?</i></font>

345
00:26:46,044 --> 00:26:47,512
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She's, uh...</i></font>

346
00:26:50,449 --> 00:26:52,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She was a bit
older than me,</i></font>

347
00:26:52,884 --> 00:26:55,354
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>so, when the Resistance
started, she signed up.</i></font>

348
00:26:57,122 --> 00:27:00,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She wasn't anyone special.
Not like you.</i></font>

349
00:27:03,862 --> 00:27:05,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But she did her part.</i></font>

350
00:27:08,066 --> 00:27:09,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Paid the price.</i></font>

351
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:19,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>As far as I'm concerned, they don't
come any more special than that.</i></font>

352
00:27:32,924 --> 00:27:35,861
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How was the honeymoon suite?</i></font>

353
00:27:35,894 --> 00:27:37,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, did you get any sleep?</i></font>

354
00:27:37,396 --> 00:27:38,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>None at all.</i></font>

355
00:27:48,206 --> 00:27:50,142
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I thought you might
like to see this.</i></font>

356
00:27:55,547 --> 00:27:57,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're just coming into orbit.</i></font>

357
00:28:19,104 --> 00:28:24,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ladies and gentlemen,
welcome to Cobalt One.</i></font>

358
00:28:44,664 --> 00:28:47,933
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi, Alexi,
initiate the drone launch.</i></font>

359
00:28:47,966 --> 00:28:49,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's get some hard data
on this place.</i></font>

360
00:28:49,368 --> 00:28:52,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The rest of us
head for the subdeck.</i></font>

361
00:28:52,237 --> 00:28:54,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Pilots only on the bridge
from now on.</i></font>

362
00:28:55,173 --> 00:28:56,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey.</i></font>

363
00:28:58,678 --> 00:29:00,979
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't die, okay?</i></font>

364
00:29:17,229 --> 00:29:20,031
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You might wanna strap in.</i></font>

365
00:29:21,032 --> 00:29:22,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Launching drone.</font>

366
00:29:40,986 --> 00:29:44,055
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We've got incoming.</i></font>

367
00:29:44,089 --> 00:29:47,392
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- We're not picking anything up.
- Whatever it is, it's big and closing fast.</i></font>

368
00:30:14,186 --> 00:30:16,421
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Status?
- Heavy damage to our central system.</i></font>

369
00:30:16,455 --> 00:30:18,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent, have you got
eyes on the ship?</i></font>

370
00:30:18,356 --> 00:30:20,158
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Is it pursuing us?</i></font>

371
00:30:22,260 --> 00:30:24,095
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What the hell is going on?</i></font>

372
00:30:27,599 --> 00:30:30,435
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait...
No one's driving the ship.</i></font>

373
00:30:30,469 --> 00:30:31,737
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's just stuck in orbit.</i></font>

374
00:30:57,462 --> 00:30:58,798
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The core drive
is stalling out.</i></font>

375
00:31:00,232 --> 00:31:01,233
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We have to land.</i></font>

376
00:31:04,469 --> 00:31:06,137
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Focus, people.</i></font>

377
00:31:19,150 --> 00:31:20,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Brace for impact.</i></font>

378
00:31:20,318 --> 00:31:21,586
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

379
00:32:03,595 --> 00:32:04,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Everyone all right?</i></font>

380
00:32:04,864 --> 00:32:06,398
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Yeah.
- Yeah.</i></font>

381
00:32:06,431 --> 00:32:07,633
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Yeah.
- Yeah.</i></font>

382
00:32:22,882 --> 00:32:25,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Core drive is dead on arrival.</i></font>

383
00:32:25,417 --> 00:32:29,220
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Backup generators will power
our comms for the next 24 hours.</i></font>

384
00:32:29,889 --> 00:32:31,156
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>After that...</i></font>

385
00:32:36,194 --> 00:32:37,596
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Half a plan.</i></font>

386
00:32:37,630 --> 00:32:38,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>At best.</i></font>

387
00:32:38,764 --> 00:32:41,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Only one way to get home now.
The Armada's core drive.</i></font>

388
00:32:41,634 --> 00:32:42,868
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi, what's our position?</i></font>

389
00:32:42,902 --> 00:32:46,338
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>10 clicks from the Armada.
No signs of life yet.</i></font>

390
00:32:46,371 --> 00:32:48,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Surface gravity is slightly
heavier than Earth.</i></font>

391
00:32:48,741 --> 00:32:52,344
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Should take us 6 hours
round trip.</i></font>

392
00:32:52,377 --> 00:32:55,180
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Get your team ready, Colonel.
- Yes, sir.</i></font>

393
00:32:55,213 --> 00:32:56,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go. Come on!</i></font>

394
00:32:57,783 --> 00:32:59,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're up.</i></font>

395
00:33:13,933 --> 00:33:17,870
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've been working on a cure
since this bug showed up.</i></font>

396
00:33:17,903 --> 00:33:22,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I just need a little more
time to test my serum.</i></font>

397
00:33:22,474 --> 00:33:24,476
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So you can stop all of this?</i></font>

398
00:33:25,610 --> 00:33:26,712
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Perhaps.</i></font>

399
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:30,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>if I can save Huana,</i></font>

400
00:33:30,683 --> 00:33:32,818
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>there's a possibility
I can save them all.</i></font>

401
00:33:37,422 --> 00:33:39,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They're attacking
the quarantine.</i></font>

402
00:33:39,324 --> 00:33:40,893
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We have less time
than I thought.</i></font>

403
00:33:40,926 --> 00:33:42,662
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How much more time
do you need?</i></font>

404
00:33:42,695 --> 00:33:44,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, this is no place
for you, kid.</i></font>

405
00:33:44,596 --> 00:33:46,498
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know you have weapons, Grant.</i></font>

406
00:33:46,531 --> 00:33:47,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not enough for this.</i></font>

407
00:33:47,800 --> 00:33:51,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're in the middle of the
largest Pilot Sprawl on Earth.</i></font>

408
00:33:51,236 --> 00:33:52,504
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There's no point in running.</i></font>

409
00:33:56,976 --> 00:33:59,511
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If you can hold them off
till morning...</i></font>

410
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:03,348
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I might just have a shot.</i></font>

411
00:34:06,518 --> 00:34:08,219
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What weapons
are we talking about?</i></font>

412
00:34:12,858 --> 00:34:14,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Their bodies are armor-plated.</i></font>

413
00:34:14,860 --> 00:34:16,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Aim for the eyes.</i></font>

414
00:34:16,561 --> 00:34:19,431
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If they move, kill them.</i></font>

415
00:34:25,437 --> 00:34:27,338
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Are you guys serious
about these suits?</i></font>

416
00:34:27,372 --> 00:34:29,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trust me.
You're gonna need it.</i></font>

417
00:34:29,942 --> 00:34:32,577
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stab first.
Questions later.</i></font>

418
00:34:32,610 --> 00:34:33,946
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You got a license for those?</i></font>

419
00:34:38,851 --> 00:34:40,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait... Is this...</i></font>

420
00:34:40,585 --> 00:34:42,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Special mod. Custom made
by this big guy.</i></font>

421
00:34:47,860 --> 00:34:49,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now you can fire on the go.</i></font>

422
00:34:49,527 --> 00:34:51,596
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right, let's lock and load,
Alpha Team.</i></font>

423
00:34:51,630 --> 00:34:52,865
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's going to be fine.</i></font>

424
00:34:54,499 --> 00:34:55,533
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's go time.</i></font>

425
00:34:56,367 --> 00:34:57,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeehaw.</i></font>

426
00:35:03,075 --> 00:35:05,310
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet will remain here
and guard the bridge.</i></font>

427
00:35:05,343 --> 00:35:08,513
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi and I will monitor
you all from the subdeck.</i></font>

428
00:35:08,546 --> 00:35:11,349
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cobalt's atmosphere is roughly
analogous to their ships,</i></font>

429
00:35:11,382 --> 00:35:13,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>meaning we can breathe here,
but it's low on O2,</i></font>

430
00:35:13,953 --> 00:35:17,388
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>so you better pace yourselves.
But not too slow.</i></font>

431
00:35:17,422 --> 00:35:18,958
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If you're not back
in 12 hours,</i></font>

432
00:35:18,991 --> 00:35:20,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>London will be wiped
off the map.</i></font>

433
00:35:20,726 --> 00:35:22,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So, no pressure.</i></font>

434
00:35:24,830 --> 00:35:25,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So...</i></font>

435
00:35:27,700 --> 00:35:28,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>no pressure.</i></font>

436
00:35:40,012 --> 00:35:41,847
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Guess we're really
doing this, huh?</i></font>

437
00:35:42,815 --> 00:35:44,817
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Death or glory, Corporal.</i></font>

438
00:35:46,518 --> 00:35:47,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>See you soon, Zhi.</i></font>

439
00:35:55,728 --> 00:35:58,463
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Please, I insist.</i></font>

440
00:36:31,429 --> 00:36:32,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All clear.</i></font>

441
00:36:41,073 --> 00:36:43,142
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How's our signal, Zhi?</font>

442
00:36:43,175 --> 00:36:44,944
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Loud and clear, Alpha Team.</i></font>

443
00:36:47,046 --> 00:36:48,613
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Still no signs of life.</font>

444
00:36:48,647 --> 00:36:50,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Music to my ears.</i></font>

445
00:36:59,925 --> 00:37:01,359
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Pretty trippy.</i></font>

446
00:37:03,028 --> 00:37:04,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But not entirely unpleasant.</i></font>

447
00:37:04,964 --> 00:37:06,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Keep the comms clear.</i></font>

448
00:37:51,977 --> 00:37:53,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What is it?</i></font>

449
00:38:05,157 --> 00:38:07,026
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just a healthy
fear of the dark.</i></font>

450
00:38:27,279 --> 00:38:29,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How can this entire
place be empty?</i></font>

451
00:38:30,015 --> 00:38:31,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Maybe they left.</i></font>

452
00:38:31,183 --> 00:38:33,018
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Then why is
the Armada still here?</i></font>

453
00:38:33,052 --> 00:38:34,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Perhaps you damaged it
more than we thought?</i></font>

454
00:38:34,954 --> 00:38:37,588
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, if that's the case, then how
the hell are we supposed to get home?</i></font>

455
00:38:37,622 --> 00:38:39,557
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How many times
do I have to remind everyone?</i></font>

456
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:41,492
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're on a goddamn
stealth mission, here.</i></font>

457
00:38:41,526 --> 00:38:43,095
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So shut your...</i></font>

458
00:38:52,237 --> 00:38:53,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Free to engage?</i></font>

459
00:38:57,608 --> 00:38:59,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Anything moves...
burn it.</i></font>

460
00:38:59,845 --> 00:39:01,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So much for
your stealth mission.</i></font>

461
00:39:08,153 --> 00:39:09,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And what if...</i></font>

462
00:39:10,990 --> 00:39:12,257
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>nothing's moving?</i></font>

463
00:39:20,265 --> 00:39:21,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No rush.</i></font>

464
00:39:21,934 --> 00:39:23,102
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just the end of the world.</i></font>

465
00:39:28,340 --> 00:39:30,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Nav points to that cavern.</i></font>

466
00:39:30,209 --> 00:39:31,910
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Another 3 clicks
to the Armada.</i></font>

467
00:39:32,711 --> 00:39:33,712
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right.</i></font>

468
00:39:34,079 --> 00:39:35,147
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go.</i></font>

469
00:39:36,348 --> 00:39:37,548
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Watch your backs.</i></font>

470
00:40:08,847 --> 00:40:09,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How's our signal?</i></font>

471
00:40:09,915 --> 00:40:12,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Owens, there's interference.</font>

472
00:40:13,786 --> 00:40:15,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Damn.</i></font>

473
00:40:50,089 --> 00:40:51,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Owens?
- Yeah?</i></font>

474
00:40:51,757 --> 00:40:53,892
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I think I know why
this place is empty.</i></font>

475
00:40:58,097 --> 00:40:59,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's a tomb.</i></font>

476
00:41:01,433 --> 00:41:02,634
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

477
00:41:20,119 --> 00:41:22,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've got movement.
North wall. Two signatures.</i></font>

478
00:41:22,421 --> 00:41:23,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What?</i></font>

479
00:41:23,889 --> 00:41:25,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What are you talking about?</i></font>

480
00:41:26,892 --> 00:41:28,193
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent. Trent, no!</i></font>

481
00:41:28,227 --> 00:41:29,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent, wait!</i></font>

482
00:41:29,962 --> 00:41:31,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Stay in formation!
- Where the hell is he going?</i></font>

483
00:41:31,763 --> 00:41:34,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- I don't know.
- Well, what did he just say to you?</i></font>

484
00:41:34,233 --> 00:41:35,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>These aren't Harvesters.</i></font>

485
00:41:38,770 --> 00:41:40,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Two signatures. South wall!</i></font>

486
00:41:45,444 --> 00:41:47,713
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whatever they are,
they're surrounding us.</i></font>

487
00:41:49,715 --> 00:41:52,017
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi, talk to me?</i></font>

488
00:41:52,050 --> 00:41:54,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi! Damn.</i></font>

489
00:42:00,259 --> 00:42:01,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait! You could hit Trent.</i></font>

490
00:42:01,727 --> 00:42:03,228
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He should've stayed
in formation, God damn it!</i></font>

491
00:42:05,230 --> 00:42:06,298
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

492
00:42:06,832 --> 00:42:07,833
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Move!</i></font>

493
00:42:08,767 --> 00:42:10,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Christ's sake.</i></font>

494
00:42:11,003 --> 00:42:12,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm gonna
kill you, Trent.</i></font>

495
00:42:32,424 --> 00:42:33,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You hit something...</i></font>

496
00:42:50,776 --> 00:42:51,877
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What is it?</i></font>

497
00:42:53,979 --> 00:42:55,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I don't know.</i></font>

498
00:43:02,854 --> 00:43:04,423
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What's going on, guys?</i></font>

499
00:43:14,499 --> 00:43:16,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Some kind of camouflage.</i></font>

500
00:43:23,141 --> 00:43:25,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Alexi?</font>

501
00:43:25,244 --> 00:43:26,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi?</i></font>

502
00:43:27,412 --> 00:43:28,847
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go again, Zhi.</i></font>

503
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:29,948
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's up?</font>

504
00:43:29,982 --> 00:43:31,483
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Zhi?
- It's gone.</i></font>

505
00:43:32,251 --> 00:43:33,819
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Where'd it go?</i></font>

506
00:43:33,852 --> 00:43:35,354
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What d'you mean
it's gone?</i></font>

507
00:43:35,387 --> 00:43:37,322
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's still alive.</i></font>

508
00:43:37,356 --> 00:43:38,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go back to backs.</i></font>

509
00:43:38,991 --> 00:43:40,392
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stay in formation.</i></font>

510
00:43:45,163 --> 00:43:46,231
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're cut off.</i></font>

511
00:43:46,265 --> 00:43:47,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No visual, no comm.</i></font>

512
00:43:47,833 --> 00:43:48,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What, everything?</i></font>

513
00:43:48,800 --> 00:43:51,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Did you hear that?</i></font>

514
00:43:56,074 --> 00:43:58,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi!</i></font>

515
00:44:01,146 --> 00:44:03,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Owens!
- Take the shot!</i></font>

516
00:44:13,025 --> 00:44:14,226
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm all right. I'm okay.</i></font>

517
00:44:14,259 --> 00:44:15,394
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Look out!</i></font>

518
00:44:21,933 --> 00:44:23,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What the...</i></font>

519
00:44:24,870 --> 00:44:26,471
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It can't see.</i></font>

520
00:44:39,017 --> 00:44:41,420
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You see that? D'you see
what they are now?</i></font>

521
00:44:42,454 --> 00:44:43,455
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Bloody shells.</i></font>

522
00:44:46,892 --> 00:44:48,093
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose!</i></font>

523
00:44:49,227 --> 00:44:50,495
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Incoming!</i></font>

524
00:45:03,975 --> 00:45:05,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go get Rose! I'll cover you!</i></font>

525
00:45:33,138 --> 00:45:34,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ha!</i></font>

526
00:45:45,651 --> 00:45:48,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

527
00:45:48,153 --> 00:45:50,956
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Could use that gift
of yours right about now.</i></font>

528
00:45:53,492 --> 00:45:55,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit, something's wrong.</i></font>

529
00:45:55,360 --> 00:45:57,663
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, that's just terrific.</i></font>

530
00:45:59,665 --> 00:46:02,067
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, you gotta be kidding me!</i></font>

531
00:46:18,283 --> 00:46:19,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi, wait!</i></font>

532
00:46:36,702 --> 00:46:38,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi!</i></font>

533
00:47:21,647 --> 00:47:23,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get up!</i></font>

534
00:47:26,318 --> 00:47:29,421
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi! Hold on! Hold on!</i></font>

535
00:47:29,454 --> 00:47:30,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>My leg...</i></font>

536
00:47:31,724 --> 00:47:32,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Okay, just breathe.</i></font>

537
00:47:32,825 --> 00:47:35,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Son of a bitch.
- Come on. Trent will carry you.</i></font>

538
00:47:35,761 --> 00:47:37,697
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're gonna pick you up, okay?</i></font>

539
00:47:37,730 --> 00:47:39,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi, come on.
Now, you've got this.</i></font>

540
00:47:40,666 --> 00:47:43,468
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Tell Zhi I'll be
waiting for him.</i></font>

541
00:47:44,603 --> 00:47:46,137
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Wha...
- We will.</i></font>

542
00:47:46,171 --> 00:47:47,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We gotta go.</i></font>

543
00:47:47,372 --> 00:47:49,709
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- No! Owens, we're not leaving her here.
- We gotta go.</i></font>

544
00:47:49,742 --> 00:47:53,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- We're not leaving her here.
- You don't get to make that decision.</i></font>

545
00:47:54,847 --> 00:47:56,214
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Please.</i></font>

546
00:47:56,816 --> 00:47:58,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go.</i></font>

547
00:48:08,493 --> 00:48:10,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi, I'm sorry.</i></font>

548
00:48:10,195 --> 00:48:11,429
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're worth it.</i></font>

549
00:48:13,733 --> 00:48:14,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go on.</i></font>

550
00:48:15,835 --> 00:48:17,035
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go for it.</i></font>

551
00:48:18,270 --> 00:48:19,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go!</i></font>

552
00:48:19,404 --> 00:48:22,107
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Come on, Rose. Go! Let's move! Move it!
- Go!</i></font>

553
00:48:26,311 --> 00:48:27,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Move!</i></font>

554
00:48:46,766 --> 00:48:48,466
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Take cover!</i></font>

555
00:48:50,602 --> 00:48:52,537
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Something's happened to her.</i></font>

556
00:48:54,539 --> 00:48:56,608
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, we don't know what
it is yet. It could be anything.</i></font>

557
00:48:58,276 --> 00:49:00,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about the drone?</i></font>

558
00:49:00,378 --> 00:49:03,181
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Uh, we lost our comm link
to it in the crash.</i></font>

559
00:49:05,651 --> 00:49:09,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But, I should be able
to reboot it from the launch bay.</i></font>

560
00:49:09,354 --> 00:49:10,555
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, get on it.</i></font>

561
00:49:31,610 --> 00:49:33,713
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah.
Yeah, I'm okay.</i></font>

562
00:49:33,746 --> 00:49:35,347
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Thanks to you.
You good?</i></font>

563
00:49:36,481 --> 00:49:39,517
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go.
Okay, come on.</i></font>

564
00:49:43,188 --> 00:49:44,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Care to explain yourselves?</i></font>

565
00:49:44,422 --> 00:49:45,557
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You wanna do this right now?</i></font>

566
00:49:45,590 --> 00:49:47,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I have one dead solider,</i></font>

567
00:49:47,359 --> 00:49:49,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>a second who disobeyed
a direct order,</i></font>

568
00:49:49,962 --> 00:49:54,934
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>and a third who's either unable or
unwilling to do her goddamn job.</i></font>

569
00:49:57,335 --> 00:49:58,503
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, shut it shell!</i></font>

570
00:49:58,536 --> 00:49:59,839
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're the one who ran off!</i></font>

571
00:49:59,872 --> 00:50:01,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, he was trying
to protect us.</i></font>

572
00:50:01,373 --> 00:50:02,908
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, no thanks to you!</i></font>

573
00:50:02,942 --> 00:50:06,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You had one job
and once again you froze up.</i></font>

574
00:50:06,277 --> 00:50:07,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And a good soldier died.</i></font>

575
00:50:09,347 --> 00:50:10,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She doesn't know, does she?</i></font>

576
00:50:14,519 --> 00:50:15,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Know what?</i></font>

577
00:50:21,226 --> 00:50:24,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>His sister was on that ship
you destroyed.</i></font>

578
00:50:27,867 --> 00:50:29,835
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now I'm gonna
ask you this only once.</i></font>

579
00:50:32,838 --> 00:50:36,174
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Can you do your job or not?</i></font>

580
00:50:44,884 --> 00:50:45,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

581
00:50:49,889 --> 00:50:53,224
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>When was the last time you really used your powers?</i></font>

582
00:50:53,258 --> 00:50:54,259
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A month?</i></font>

583
00:50:55,527 --> 00:50:56,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A year?</i></font>

584
00:50:59,364 --> 00:51:00,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The Armada?</i></font>

585
00:51:01,867 --> 00:51:04,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Ever since we've been here,
things have just been off.</i></font>

586
00:51:04,804 --> 00:51:06,304
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Off? What do you mean off?</i></font>

587
00:51:09,809 --> 00:51:13,913
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Christ. If you can't do this...
- I know what's at stake, Owens. Okay?</i></font>

588
00:51:15,681 --> 00:51:17,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And I'm not afraid
to die for it.</i></font>

589
00:51:22,353 --> 00:51:23,354
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This...</i></font>

590
00:51:25,523 --> 00:51:26,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>gift...</i></font>

591
00:51:28,426 --> 00:51:30,395
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>has been killing me
my whole life.</i></font>

592
00:51:31,529 --> 00:51:33,398
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Figured I got one last shot.</i></font>

593
00:51:37,036 --> 00:51:38,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So let's make it count.</i></font>

594
00:52:49,108 --> 00:52:50,876
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Elbows down and in.</i></font>

595
00:52:58,651 --> 00:53:00,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I was never much of
a fan of these, either.</i></font>

596
00:53:02,121 --> 00:53:03,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No choice without your cure.</i></font>

597
00:53:04,757 --> 00:53:05,991
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We'll see.</i></font>

598
00:53:06,025 --> 00:53:07,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've injected half into Huana.</i></font>

599
00:53:08,727 --> 00:53:10,395
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now all we can do is wait.</i></font>

600
00:53:12,631 --> 00:53:13,632
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You try.</i></font>

601
00:53:34,687 --> 00:53:35,855
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grant!</i></font>

602
00:53:37,522 --> 00:53:38,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grant!</i></font>

603
00:53:44,562 --> 00:53:45,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get back!</i></font>

604
00:53:46,799 --> 00:53:49,134
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey! Over here!</i></font>

605
00:53:49,869 --> 00:53:50,903
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Eat this!</i></font>

606
00:53:52,838 --> 00:53:54,572
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grant, no!</i></font>

607
00:54:00,779 --> 00:54:02,614
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Doc! Come and get it!</i></font>

608
00:54:11,190 --> 00:54:13,591
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit. I need a stronger dose.</i></font>

609
00:54:20,866 --> 00:54:24,535
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grant! No, no, no.
Grant, Grant, Grant. Please, please.</i></font>

610
00:54:30,643 --> 00:54:33,746
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Sun's on my face, ain't it?</i></font>

611
00:54:46,524 --> 00:54:47,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let him go.</i></font>

612
00:54:51,997 --> 00:54:53,933
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We have to move. Now.</i></font>

613
00:54:55,566 --> 00:54:56,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get under.</i></font>

614
00:55:06,679 --> 00:55:07,813
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There she is.</i></font>

615
00:55:08,781 --> 00:55:10,182
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The Armada Vessel.</i></font>

616
00:55:36,574 --> 00:55:37,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, where do you
think you're going?</i></font>

617
00:55:38,911 --> 00:55:40,145
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just give me a minute.</i></font>

618
00:55:42,781 --> 00:55:43,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cover her.</i></font>

619
00:55:50,856 --> 00:55:51,890
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What is it?</i></font>

620
00:55:56,829 --> 00:55:57,863
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Looks human.</i></font>

621
00:56:00,165 --> 00:56:01,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Maybe from one of our probes.</i></font>

622
00:56:03,568 --> 00:56:04,837
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Scan it back at the ship.</i></font>

623
00:56:07,072 --> 00:56:09,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Leon, I... I... I can't.
- Just forget it. All right?</i></font>

624
00:56:12,778 --> 00:56:13,779
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't.</i></font>

625
00:56:25,257 --> 00:56:29,094
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Look, I wish I could explain
why it happened.</i></font>

626
00:56:31,663 --> 00:56:32,664
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But...</i></font>

627
00:56:36,101 --> 00:56:37,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I meant what I said
about your sister.</i></font>

628
00:56:50,883 --> 00:56:51,917
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Incoming!</i></font>

629
00:57:02,694 --> 00:57:03,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

630
00:57:09,334 --> 00:57:11,103
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Run to that light shaft!</i></font>

631
00:57:11,136 --> 00:57:12,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Run, run.
- Now, run!</i></font>

632
00:57:18,110 --> 00:57:19,778
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get into the light.
Don't move.</i></font>

633
00:57:19,812 --> 00:57:20,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trust me.</i></font>

634
00:57:20,879 --> 00:57:21,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hurry, Trent!</i></font>

635
00:57:30,189 --> 00:57:34,259
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They can't see through the light...
I think.</i></font>

636
00:57:35,227 --> 00:57:37,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You think or you know?</i></font>

637
00:57:37,062 --> 00:57:38,197
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I think.</i></font>

638
00:57:49,875 --> 00:57:53,145
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's working.
It's working.</i></font>

639
00:58:06,325 --> 00:58:08,694
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Son of a bitch.
It must be sundown.</i></font>

640
00:58:09,394 --> 00:58:11,196
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, that was short-lived.</i></font>

641
00:58:16,802 --> 00:58:18,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Lock and load, Corporal.</i></font>

642
00:58:24,443 --> 00:58:26,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, shit. Oh, shit.</i></font>

643
00:58:34,987 --> 00:58:35,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Our eye in the sky.</i></font>

644
00:58:36,722 --> 00:58:39,992
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go!
Run for it! Let's go.</i></font>

645
00:58:40,025 --> 00:58:41,293
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What are those things?</i></font>

646
00:58:41,927 --> 00:58:43,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Pilots?</i></font>

647
00:58:44,496 --> 00:58:46,198
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Maybe a new species.</i></font>

648
00:58:47,232 --> 00:58:49,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A mutation.</i></font>

649
00:58:52,804 --> 00:58:54,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wipe them out.</i></font>

650
00:58:56,775 --> 00:58:58,076
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's for Alexi.</i></font>

651
00:59:01,480 --> 00:59:02,714
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Open the door.</i></font>

652
00:59:04,383 --> 00:59:07,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go. Go. Go. Go!</i></font>

653
00:59:08,086 --> 00:59:09,087
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go.</i></font>

654
00:59:23,335 --> 00:59:24,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Careful, Trent.</i></font>

655
00:59:26,305 --> 00:59:29,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Looks like nobody's home.</i></font>

656
00:59:29,374 --> 00:59:34,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If all the Pilots turned rabid, then
what the hell happened to the Harvesters?</i></font>

657
00:59:34,413 --> 00:59:36,114
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You think they got sick, too?</i></font>

658
00:59:36,148 --> 00:59:37,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This way. Let's go.</i></font>

659
00:59:53,131 --> 00:59:54,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There it is.</i></font>

660
01:00:03,508 --> 01:00:05,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Outstanding.</i></font>

661
01:00:23,595 --> 01:00:24,796
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're up.</i></font>

662
01:00:34,439 --> 01:00:35,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, big ugly.</i></font>

663
01:00:37,009 --> 01:00:38,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If I'm...</i></font>

664
01:00:40,312 --> 01:00:43,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If I'm gone,
promise me you'll finish this.</i></font>

665
01:00:48,854 --> 01:00:49,855
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No matter what.</i></font>

666
01:02:07,099 --> 01:02:08,233
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What the hell is going on?</i></font>

667
01:02:16,709 --> 01:02:18,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose?</i></font>

668
01:02:19,077 --> 01:02:20,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You all right?</i></font>

669
01:02:53,345 --> 01:02:55,147
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What the hell happened to her?</i></font>

670
01:02:55,180 --> 01:02:57,349
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>She went native.</i></font>

671
01:03:28,046 --> 01:03:29,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Doesn't matter.</i></font>

672
01:03:29,481 --> 01:03:30,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The core drive is down there.</i></font>

673
01:03:34,553 --> 01:03:38,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Relax, Trent. Finding the drive gives
us the best chance of finding Rose.</i></font>

674
01:03:42,093 --> 01:03:44,996
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And what if she tries to
stop us again, huh?</i></font>

675
01:03:45,030 --> 01:03:47,132
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You made a promise. Remember?</i></font>

676
01:04:03,716 --> 01:04:04,717
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go get her.</i></font>

677
01:04:54,700 --> 01:04:56,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They're off the grid.</i></font>

678
01:04:57,737 --> 01:04:59,538
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I knew we couldn't trust them.</i></font>

679
01:04:59,571 --> 01:05:02,307
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, we haven't exactly
been forthcoming, have we?</i></font>

680
01:05:02,340 --> 01:05:03,709
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stop. You're breaking my heart.</i></font>

681
01:05:03,743 --> 01:05:07,412
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm just saying this is their world.
Let them do the dirty work.</i></font>

682
01:05:09,281 --> 01:05:11,784
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No one's gonna get out
of this one clean, kid.</i></font>

683
01:08:12,464 --> 01:08:13,598
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Rose.</font>

684
01:08:21,306 --> 01:08:22,307
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I promise.</font>

685
01:08:35,721 --> 01:08:36,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All this time.</i></font>

686
01:08:37,990 --> 01:08:39,357
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All the doubt.</font>

687
01:08:41,426 --> 01:08:42,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All the fear.</font>

688
01:08:44,329 --> 01:08:45,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It was you.</i></font>

689
01:08:52,972 --> 01:08:54,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You know what? You're right.</i></font>

690
01:08:57,575 --> 01:08:59,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I didn't come here
to destroy you.</i></font>

691
01:09:00,713 --> 01:09:01,714
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But I will.</i></font>

692
01:09:08,453 --> 01:09:09,454
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You okay?</i></font>

693
01:09:11,056 --> 01:09:12,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go.</i></font>

694
01:09:26,571 --> 01:09:27,572
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose?</i></font>

695
01:09:36,581 --> 01:09:38,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Holy shit.</i></font>

696
01:09:45,758 --> 01:09:47,059
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How did you do that?</i></font>

697
01:09:48,761 --> 01:09:50,428
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I finally stopped
fighting my nature.</i></font>

698
01:09:50,461 --> 01:09:53,398
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But you're feeling
okay now, right?</i></font>

699
01:09:53,431 --> 01:09:57,703
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>'Cause, you know, because, like,
I mean, y-y-you look, uh... great.</i></font>

700
01:09:57,736 --> 01:09:58,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Where's the core drive?</i></font>

701
01:09:59,939 --> 01:10:01,073
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's right there.</i></font>

702
01:10:04,143 --> 01:10:05,711
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You hit like a girl.</i></font>

703
01:10:08,881 --> 01:10:10,082
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You did it.</i></font>

704
01:10:10,115 --> 01:10:10,983
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We did it.</i></font>

705
01:10:11,016 --> 01:10:13,384
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Save the group hug
for later. Let's go!</i></font>

706
01:10:13,418 --> 01:10:14,653
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come on, move it.</i></font>

707
01:10:26,031 --> 01:10:27,032
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cover us.</i></font>

708
01:10:34,006 --> 01:10:35,473
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Time to get your hands dirty.</i></font>

709
01:10:37,142 --> 01:10:38,509
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Payback's a bitch.</i></font>

710
01:10:40,779 --> 01:10:41,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come on.</i></font>

711
01:11:10,843 --> 01:11:12,477
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wrong choice, Corporal.</i></font>

712
01:11:17,950 --> 01:11:19,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

713
01:11:19,084 --> 01:11:20,585
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent! Get down!</i></font>

714
01:11:23,255 --> 01:11:24,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He blew the hatch!</font>

715
01:11:24,156 --> 01:11:26,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Probably hostiles
at his back.</i></font>

716
01:11:26,491 --> 01:11:27,558
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And the others?</i></font>

717
01:11:27,592 --> 01:11:29,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, we can only
pray for them now.</i></font>

718
01:11:29,995 --> 01:11:32,197
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But thank God
he's got the core drive.</i></font>

719
01:11:32,998 --> 01:11:34,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Clear his path home.</i></font>

720
01:11:50,249 --> 01:11:51,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You knew...</i></font>

721
01:12:39,865 --> 01:12:41,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose, I'm sor...</i></font>

722
01:12:47,006 --> 01:12:48,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't even...</i></font>

723
01:13:07,760 --> 01:13:10,829
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Grant's dead. Your serum is a bust.
And we're completely surrounded.</i></font>

724
01:13:10,863 --> 01:13:12,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What the hell
are we gonna do?</i></font>

725
01:13:12,998 --> 01:13:14,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're gonna fight to the end.</i></font>

726
01:13:15,000 --> 01:13:16,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just like Grant did.</i></font>

727
01:13:16,835 --> 01:13:19,071
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now let's get to Huana
before they do.</i></font>

728
01:13:25,844 --> 01:13:26,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait.</i></font>

729
01:13:27,713 --> 01:13:28,814
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right, go.</i></font>

730
01:13:31,750 --> 01:13:34,219
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Hey, ladies. What are you up to?
- Shh.</i></font>

731
01:13:35,620 --> 01:13:36,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Quick!</i></font>

732
01:13:57,643 --> 01:13:58,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go!</i></font>

733
01:14:11,790 --> 01:14:13,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So the serum actually works?</i></font>

734
01:14:13,826 --> 01:14:16,228
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trust me, I'm just as
surprised as you are.</i></font>

735
01:14:16,261 --> 01:14:17,628
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cover the entrance.</i></font>

736
01:14:18,964 --> 01:14:21,100
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get what we need.</i></font>

737
01:14:21,900 --> 01:14:23,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This'll do.</i></font>

738
01:14:24,369 --> 01:14:25,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get the hell out of here.</i></font>

739
01:14:34,113 --> 01:14:37,316
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No respect for science.</i></font>

740
01:14:44,723 --> 01:14:45,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How's he doing?</i></font>

741
01:14:49,795 --> 01:14:51,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You don't look so good
either, Rose.</i></font>

742
01:14:53,899 --> 01:14:55,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Please, just let me help you.</i></font>

743
01:14:56,768 --> 01:14:58,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know you need it.</i></font>

744
01:15:08,247 --> 01:15:09,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And Trent?</i></font>

745
01:15:10,415 --> 01:15:13,152
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What did he inject him with?</i></font>

746
01:15:13,185 --> 01:15:17,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All I know is that
they want that core drive.</i></font>

747
01:15:18,524 --> 01:15:20,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And they're gonna do everything
they can to get it.</i></font>

748
01:15:21,026 --> 01:15:22,694
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Why?</i></font>

749
01:15:22,728 --> 01:15:24,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And don't you bullshit me.</i></font>

750
01:15:25,197 --> 01:15:29,234
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's some kind of weapon.</i></font>

751
01:15:31,203 --> 01:15:34,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Powerful enough to wipe every
Pilot off the face of the Earth.</i></font>

752
01:15:40,045 --> 01:15:41,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Then why are you helping us?</i></font>

753
01:15:45,350 --> 01:15:47,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>'Cause, I knew...</i></font>

754
01:15:48,420 --> 01:15:53,058
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I knew deep down...
why you froze up.</i></font>

755
01:15:54,126 --> 01:15:56,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Why my sister died that day.</i></font>

756
01:15:56,795 --> 01:16:01,033
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I knew that you couldn't destroy
them because they're a part of you.</i></font>

757
01:16:02,968 --> 01:16:04,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And I hated you for that.</i></font>

758
01:16:06,838 --> 01:16:10,475
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But that feeling, that feeling's
simple, it's... It's easy.</i></font>

759
01:16:10,509 --> 01:16:12,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And now that I know
who you really are...</i></font>

760
01:16:14,279 --> 01:16:16,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now it's complicated.</i></font>

761
01:16:19,017 --> 01:16:20,118
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yes.</i></font>

762
01:16:23,355 --> 01:16:24,890
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yes, it is.</i></font>

763
01:16:33,799 --> 01:16:36,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If we don't get to the ship before
Owens, we're gonna be stranded here.</i></font>

764
01:16:37,536 --> 01:16:39,104
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, what d'you want me
to do? Fly?</i></font>

765
01:16:39,137 --> 01:16:40,172
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, can you?</i></font>

766
01:16:40,205 --> 01:16:41,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm serious, Rose.</i></font>

767
01:16:41,440 --> 01:16:43,108
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We've gotta pick up the pace,
otherwise we're gonna be...</i></font>

768
01:16:43,141 --> 01:16:45,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait. You see that?</i></font>

769
01:16:46,878 --> 01:16:48,513
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's the same
as our ships.</i></font>

770
01:16:49,915 --> 01:16:51,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't move.</i></font>

771
01:16:51,416 --> 01:16:53,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We'll just...
Just wait here for you.</i></font>

772
01:16:53,952 --> 01:16:58,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You know, that sister of yours really
needs to work on her communication skills.</i></font>

773
01:16:58,123 --> 01:16:59,258
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're killing me.</i></font>

774
01:17:01,059 --> 01:17:02,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit.</i></font>

775
01:17:03,428 --> 01:17:05,030
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose, we've got company!</i></font>

776
01:17:08,867 --> 01:17:10,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit...</i></font>

777
01:17:21,113 --> 01:17:22,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I guess this is it, then.</i></font>

778
01:17:27,986 --> 01:17:31,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, come on!
Come back over here! Over here!</i></font>

779
01:17:59,418 --> 01:18:00,419
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Attagirl.</i></font>

780
01:18:19,004 --> 01:18:20,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not bad for a human.</i></font>

781
01:18:20,439 --> 01:18:23,075
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Oh, finally she's impressed.</i></font>

782
01:18:24,042 --> 01:18:25,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Got one in my size?</i></font>

783
01:18:28,046 --> 01:18:30,148
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No...</i></font>

784
01:18:40,425 --> 01:18:42,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hold tight in there, Trent.</i></font>

785
01:18:44,196 --> 01:18:46,064
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- What about me?
- I'm coming.</i></font>

786
01:18:47,265 --> 01:18:48,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This shit's exhausting.</i></font>

787
01:18:48,934 --> 01:18:50,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's exhausting?
What, d'you wanna swap places?</i></font>

788
01:18:51,002 --> 01:18:52,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hmm. Cheeky.</i></font>

789
01:18:55,941 --> 01:19:00,145
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whoa! Wow. Okay.</i></font>

790
01:19:00,178 --> 01:19:02,547
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whoo! Um, do you want me to...</i></font>

791
01:19:02,581 --> 01:19:04,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just hold on to something.</i></font>

792
01:19:04,449 --> 01:19:05,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Okay... Sorry...</i></font>

793
01:19:06,017 --> 01:19:07,386
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not anything.</i></font>

794
01:19:13,592 --> 01:19:15,994
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You did good, soldier.</i></font>

795
01:19:16,027 --> 01:19:19,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hell, you did the impossible.</i></font>

796
01:19:26,004 --> 01:19:27,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about the others?</i></font>

797
01:19:27,439 --> 01:19:28,273
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Alexi?</i></font>

798
01:19:28,306 --> 01:19:32,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi, make sure
this man gets some rest.</i></font>

799
01:19:32,645 --> 01:19:34,546
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I've got it from here.</i></font>

800
01:19:39,251 --> 01:19:40,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Does this thing go
any faster?</i></font>

801
01:19:47,225 --> 01:19:48,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Jesus.</i></font>

802
01:19:52,364 --> 01:19:53,699
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This wasn't a probe.</i></font>

803
01:19:54,599 --> 01:19:55,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>This was a bomb.</i></font>

804
01:20:01,373 --> 01:20:03,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The shadow creatures...</i></font>

805
01:20:04,644 --> 01:20:05,977
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Pilots back home.</font>

806
01:20:07,612 --> 01:20:08,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Trent.</font>

807
01:20:09,715 --> 01:20:11,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's all connected.</i></font>

808
01:20:13,385 --> 01:20:15,153
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They aren't just dying...</i></font>

809
01:20:15,187 --> 01:20:17,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Payback's a bitch!</i></font>

810
01:20:17,155 --> 01:20:18,423
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They've been poisoned.</i></font>

811
01:20:21,092 --> 01:20:22,194
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Radford.</i></font>

812
01:20:24,062 --> 01:20:25,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That son of a bitch.</i></font>

813
01:20:27,332 --> 01:20:28,500
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's go get him.</i></font>

814
01:20:32,738 --> 01:20:34,372
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet.</i></font>

815
01:20:34,406 --> 01:20:35,775
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We need to install this now.</i></font>

816
01:20:40,345 --> 01:20:43,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just need to scan
for any contamination.</i></font>

817
01:20:43,281 --> 01:20:45,116
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm all right. I feel fine.</i></font>

818
01:20:45,651 --> 01:20:47,185
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's protocol, Owens.</i></font>

819
01:20:55,661 --> 01:20:58,063
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Take us to firing altitude.</i></font>

820
01:21:16,515 --> 01:21:17,516
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're too late.</i></font>

821
01:21:20,519 --> 01:21:22,755
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's give them a taste
of their own medicine.</i></font>

822
01:21:24,690 --> 01:21:25,758
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No.</i></font>

823
01:21:26,792 --> 01:21:28,293
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not a harvest.</i></font>

824
01:21:30,262 --> 01:21:31,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>An extermination.</i></font>

825
01:21:46,779 --> 01:21:48,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, it's been nice
knowing you, Rose.</i></font>

826
01:21:55,855 --> 01:21:57,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Brace yourself.</i></font>

827
01:22:03,161 --> 01:22:04,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hold on!</i></font>

828
01:22:20,445 --> 01:22:23,783
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now I am become death.</i></font>

829
01:22:37,562 --> 01:22:39,197
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Destroyer of worlds.</i></font>

830
01:22:45,838 --> 01:22:47,372
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Plot a course for home.</i></font>

831
01:22:49,374 --> 01:22:52,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Engage the drive as soon
as we're clear of the rings.</i></font>

832
01:22:57,382 --> 01:22:58,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hold on!</i></font>

833
01:22:58,450 --> 01:22:59,618
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'm holding on!</i></font>

834
01:23:13,531 --> 01:23:16,936
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose... we're in space.</i></font>

835
01:23:16,969 --> 01:23:18,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I know.</i></font>

836
01:23:21,339 --> 01:23:22,374
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>There it is.</i></font>

837
01:23:29,649 --> 01:23:30,816
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What are you gonna do?</i></font>

838
01:23:41,459 --> 01:23:43,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It's working.
We're getting closer!</i></font>

839
01:23:54,339 --> 01:23:55,473
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about Trent?</i></font>

840
01:23:56,408 --> 01:23:57,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How did he die?</i></font>

841
01:24:00,813 --> 01:24:02,180
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What's this about?</i></font>

842
01:24:05,583 --> 01:24:08,654
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just trying to figure out why
there's traces of a high thyroxine</i></font>

843
01:24:08,688 --> 01:24:10,422
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>pilot blood on your body.</i></font>

844
01:24:10,455 --> 01:24:12,590
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Same as on the diseased pilots
on Earth.</i></font>

845
01:24:12,925 --> 01:24:15,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Huh.</i></font>

846
01:24:15,593 --> 01:24:19,665
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If I didn't know any better, I'd think
they derived from the same source.</i></font>

847
01:24:53,966 --> 01:24:55,533
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Everything you've got.
This is it!</i></font>

848
01:25:18,724 --> 01:25:20,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get us back
on this ship, Rose!</i></font>

849
01:25:20,793 --> 01:25:21,794
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get us back!</i></font>

850
01:25:55,527 --> 01:25:56,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Motherfucker.</i></font>

851
01:25:58,030 --> 01:25:59,732
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose?</i></font>

852
01:26:01,100 --> 01:26:03,434
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get you to the med lab.
We've got some blood there.</i></font>

853
01:26:18,516 --> 01:26:20,719
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I really like what you've done
with your hair.</i></font>

854
01:26:22,888 --> 01:26:26,025
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Obviously, it wasn't supposed
to be like this.</i></font>

855
01:26:26,058 --> 01:26:27,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>General!</i></font>

856
01:26:27,893 --> 01:26:29,094
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Zhi.</i></font>

857
01:26:29,128 --> 01:26:31,831
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Can't you see
they've been compromised?</i></font>

858
01:26:31,864 --> 01:26:34,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He's not the sharpest.
Just look at her.</i></font>

859
01:26:34,499 --> 01:26:35,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't listen to him, Zhi.</i></font>

860
01:26:35,835 --> 01:26:37,837
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He's been lying
from the beginning.</i></font>

861
01:26:37,870 --> 01:26:40,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>He bombed Cobalt
before we got here.</i></font>

862
01:26:40,405 --> 01:26:42,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And then he unleashed the same
virus on the Pilots back home.</i></font>

863
01:26:42,708 --> 01:26:43,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I know.</font>

864
01:26:43,876 --> 01:26:45,177
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And I have the proof.</i></font>

865
01:26:45,211 --> 01:26:47,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Shoot them and I send it to
every military base on Earth.</font>

866
01:26:47,680 --> 01:26:49,414
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Be my guest.</i></font>

867
01:26:49,447 --> 01:26:52,151
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Half of them will probably thank me.
Call me a hero.</i></font>

868
01:26:52,184 --> 01:26:53,518
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Or a piece of shit.</i></font>

869
01:26:54,653 --> 01:26:56,789
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, now, that's just rude.</i></font>

870
01:26:57,622 --> 01:26:59,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No!</i></font>

871
01:27:03,195 --> 01:27:04,429
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Damn it!</i></font>

872
01:27:04,462 --> 01:27:06,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You chose the wrong side, Rose.</i></font>

873
01:27:06,198 --> 01:27:08,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Of what? Genocide?</i></font>

874
01:27:10,669 --> 01:27:13,772
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The virus was meant to euthanize
the Pilots peacefully.</i></font>

875
01:27:14,106 --> 01:27:15,908
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Humanely.</i></font>

876
01:27:15,941 --> 01:27:17,977
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>And you thought it worked, too.</i></font>

877
01:27:18,010 --> 01:27:21,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So you let it loose
in your own backyard.</i></font>

878
01:27:21,080 --> 01:27:24,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But you had no goddamn clue what
you did until it was too late.</i></font>

879
01:27:24,515 --> 01:27:26,952
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, thanks to you,
I can mop up that error,</i></font>

880
01:27:26,986 --> 01:27:30,421
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>eradicate every last one
of them, and save London.</i></font>

881
01:27:30,455 --> 01:27:33,659
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All in time for tea.</i></font>

882
01:27:35,861 --> 01:27:38,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now I can give the Earth
back to mankind.</i></font>

883
01:27:38,998 --> 01:27:40,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The real mankind.</i></font>

884
01:27:41,901 --> 01:27:43,168
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You know what?</i></font>

885
01:27:44,937 --> 01:27:46,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're gonna have to
fight for it.</i></font>

886
01:28:24,777 --> 01:28:26,946
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What's the matter, General?</i></font>

887
01:28:26,979 --> 01:28:28,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Afraid to fight for yourself?</i></font>

888
01:28:31,516 --> 01:28:33,618
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Not if I don't have to.</i></font>

889
01:28:43,528 --> 01:28:45,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Head for the main road?
- Brace yourself.</i></font>

890
01:28:46,732 --> 01:28:48,067
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>We're not in Kansas anymore.</i></font>

891
01:29:34,579 --> 01:29:35,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent, no!</i></font>

892
01:29:36,181 --> 01:29:37,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent! Stop.</i></font>

893
01:29:42,187 --> 01:29:43,188
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Fight it.</i></font>

894
01:29:44,156 --> 01:29:45,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stop.</i></font>

895
01:29:46,725 --> 01:29:48,093
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come back to me.</i></font>

896
01:30:08,147 --> 01:30:11,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You can't fight
their nature, Rose.</i></font>

897
01:30:13,085 --> 01:30:15,754
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That was never Trent.</i></font>

898
01:30:17,022 --> 01:30:20,659
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Or Violet.</i></font>

899
01:30:20,692 --> 01:30:22,593
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>They're abominations!</i></font>

900
01:30:22,627 --> 01:30:25,831
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Something your father and I
could never agree on.</i></font>

901
01:30:25,864 --> 01:30:27,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>So he had to go.</i></font>

902
01:30:31,136 --> 01:30:32,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>As do you.</i></font>

903
01:30:34,273 --> 01:30:36,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You cheap bastard.</i></font>

904
01:30:36,642 --> 01:30:38,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Time to pay, Corporal.</i></font>

905
01:30:47,052 --> 01:30:50,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Get the fuck out of my way.</i></font>

906
01:31:13,011 --> 01:31:14,379
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I can't let her
leave this room.</i></font>

907
01:31:16,248 --> 01:31:17,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go! Now!</i></font>

908
01:31:22,454 --> 01:31:23,655
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Open!</i></font>

909
01:31:27,159 --> 01:31:28,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose!</i></font>

910
01:31:28,427 --> 01:31:29,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go!</i></font>

911
01:31:29,995 --> 01:31:31,196
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet!</i></font>

912
01:31:31,230 --> 01:31:33,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Open the goddamn door!
That's an order!</i></font>

913
01:31:33,799 --> 01:31:34,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Open!</i></font>

914
01:31:36,201 --> 01:31:37,236
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet!</i></font>

915
01:31:44,042 --> 01:31:46,078
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- We've got to go, Rose. Come on.
- No!</i></font>

916
01:31:46,111 --> 01:31:49,014
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>If she gets to the core drive,
she'll kill everyone on Earth.</i></font>

917
01:31:49,047 --> 01:31:50,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose!</i></font>

918
01:31:52,017 --> 01:31:53,852
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Fine. If you're staying,
I'm staying.</i></font>

919
01:32:05,130 --> 01:32:07,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet's taking us
into the wormhole.</i></font>

920
01:32:07,399 --> 01:32:10,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Go get Trent
and get out of here. Now!</i></font>

921
01:32:15,908 --> 01:32:17,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What about you?</i></font>

922
01:32:18,377 --> 01:32:20,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I have to finish this myself.</i></font>

923
01:32:44,770 --> 01:32:48,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Easy, now, big guy. Easy.</i></font>

924
01:32:49,208 --> 01:32:50,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent, wait! It's not you.</i></font>

925
01:32:51,543 --> 01:32:52,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No! No!</i></font>

926
01:33:22,107 --> 01:33:24,276
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent! You need to snap
out of this!</i></font>

927
01:33:36,955 --> 01:33:38,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent! I know you're in there!</i></font>

928
01:33:58,610 --> 01:34:01,213
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come on, get your
shit together, mate!</i></font>

929
01:34:10,355 --> 01:34:12,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent! Trent!</i></font>

930
01:34:16,094 --> 01:34:17,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hold on!</i></font>

931
01:35:02,074 --> 01:35:03,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Rose!</i></font>

932
01:35:08,046 --> 01:35:09,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Don't let go!</i></font>

933
01:35:30,469 --> 01:35:31,470
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No!</i></font>

934
01:36:39,404 --> 01:36:40,439
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Trent.</i></font>

935
01:36:40,472 --> 01:36:42,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Stay with me.</i></font>

936
01:36:42,742 --> 01:36:47,479
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You'll be okay.
You'll be okay.</i></font>

937
01:37:02,027 --> 01:37:04,062
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right. Good as new.</i></font>

938
01:37:32,658 --> 01:37:34,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>It sounds bad, but...</i></font>

939
01:37:36,829 --> 01:37:39,097
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I never really saw them
as human.</i></font>

940
01:37:40,332 --> 01:37:41,399
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Just the enemy.</i></font>

941
01:37:42,702 --> 01:37:44,670
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A reminder of everything
I've lost.</i></font>

942
01:37:47,640 --> 01:37:49,742
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>But now?</i></font>

943
01:37:49,775 --> 01:37:54,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Now all I see is a brother willing
to give his life for his sister...</i></font>

944
01:37:57,817 --> 01:37:59,584
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>and a dickhead like me.</i></font>

945
01:38:03,355 --> 01:38:05,390
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Yeah, well,
I think he likes you.</i></font>

946
01:38:06,558 --> 01:38:07,559
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You reckon?</i></font>

947
01:38:10,161 --> 01:38:11,697
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>You're still alive, aren't you?</i></font>

948
01:38:14,566 --> 01:38:15,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Good point.</i></font>

949
01:39:06,484 --> 01:39:08,587
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- How far are we from London?
- Violet?</i></font>

950
01:39:10,155 --> 01:39:11,590
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's get there
as fast as we can.</i></font>

951
01:39:29,574 --> 01:39:31,543
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- It's too late.
- What are we gonna do now?</i></font>

952
01:39:31,576 --> 01:39:33,378
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How are we supposed
to stop them all?</i></font>

953
01:39:36,581 --> 01:39:37,817
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Leave that to me.</i></font>

954
01:40:31,603 --> 01:40:33,873
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- How the hell did you to that?
- Which part?</i></font>

955
01:40:33,906 --> 01:40:34,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All of it.</i></font>

956
01:40:35,007 --> 01:40:37,677
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Let's just say,
between your serum and my ship,</i></font>

957
01:40:37,710 --> 01:40:40,278
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>we have more than enough power
now to cure everyone.</i></font>

958
01:40:40,311 --> 01:40:41,847
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Well, I guess
we're finally even.</i></font>

959
01:40:41,881 --> 01:40:43,214
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I guess we are.</i></font>

960
01:40:59,732 --> 01:41:02,333
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Look at you, all grown up.</i></font>

961
01:41:02,802 --> 01:41:04,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wait.</i></font>

962
01:41:06,504 --> 01:41:07,673
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Where's Grant?</i></font>

963
01:41:10,910 --> 01:41:13,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Wish he could have been here
to see this.</i></font>

964
01:41:13,278 --> 01:41:15,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The stories he'd have told.</i></font>

965
01:41:17,750 --> 01:41:19,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I guess now it's your turn.</i></font>

966
01:41:20,019 --> 01:41:22,253
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come on. I'm double-parked.</i></font>

967
01:41:41,674 --> 01:41:42,540
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Guys.</i></font>

968
01:41:42,574 --> 01:41:44,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Doc says it's gonna take
a couple of weeks</i></font>

969
01:41:44,210 --> 01:41:49,782
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>to get used to the new body, but introducing
the new and improved Trent Corley.</i></font>

970
01:41:52,685 --> 01:41:55,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Nah, you look good, man.
You look great.</i></font>

971
01:41:56,521 --> 01:41:57,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>How'd you get uglier?</i></font>

972
01:42:01,392 --> 01:42:02,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Hey, guys.</i></font>

973
01:42:02,928 --> 01:42:04,395
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Have a look at this.</i></font>

974
01:42:05,597 --> 01:42:07,867
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I hacked Radford's
personal files.</i></font>

975
01:42:07,900 --> 01:42:09,034
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>What is it?</i></font>

976
01:42:09,068 --> 01:42:10,035
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>A prison.</i></font>

977
01:42:10,069 --> 01:42:12,537
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Where he kept
all his enemies of the state.</i></font>

978
01:42:17,042 --> 01:42:18,510
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Including your father.</i></font>

979
01:42:24,683 --> 01:42:27,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Violet. Set a new course.</i></font>

980
01:42:28,520 --> 01:42:29,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I told you so.</i></font>

981
01:42:46,906 --> 01:42:48,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I'll go out again.</i></font>

982
01:42:49,775 --> 01:42:50,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cut!</i></font>

983
01:42:55,981 --> 01:42:59,785
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Whoa. Oh, yes.
It's quite fun, actually.</i></font>

984
01:43:02,755 --> 01:43:03,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Watch your step.</i></font>

985
01:43:13,699 --> 01:43:14,934
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Cut!</i></font>

986
01:43:17,102 --> 01:43:18,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Cut!
- Cha! Cha! Cha!</i></font>

987
01:43:18,637 --> 01:43:21,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>I run fast, despite what they...</i></font>

988
01:43:21,040 --> 01:43:22,507
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>All right, I do!</i></font>

989
01:43:24,777 --> 01:43:27,478
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Got him!</i></font>

990
01:43:29,715 --> 01:43:31,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>- Catch!
- Whoa!</i></font>

991
01:43:44,096 --> 01:43:45,430
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Fuck!</i></font>

992
01:43:46,131 --> 01:43:48,433
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Shit!</i></font>

993
01:43:49,935 --> 01:43:52,137
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Sorry!</i></font>

994
01:43:57,609 --> 01:44:00,679
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>That's sweet.
It's just great that it's you.</i></font>

995
01:44:07,119 --> 01:44:09,621
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Check! Sorry!</i></font>

996
01:44:09,655 --> 01:44:11,824
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>The leg fell off the table!</i></font>

997
01:44:50,029 --> 01:44:52,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>No, come on!
Don't give up on me, Rose!</i></font>

998
01:44:52,998 --> 01:44:55,234
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Do not give up on me.
You got this. Come on.</i></font>

999
01:44:55,267 --> 01:44:57,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Come on, yes. Yes!
It's working...</i></font>

1000
01:44:57,602 --> 01:45:01,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Fuck you, Liam.
What the fuck!</i></font>

1001
01:45:01,240 --> 01:45:02,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Okay, cut.
Thank you.</i></font>

